        "id": 1412036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-08-05T21:03:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also, wouldn\u0027t having provision for dma buf ops per heap be less flexible than attaching the ops per buffer - eg. latter would allow different ops for different buffer types (cached, uncached, etc) if such a need arises",
      "parentUuid": "f8bb421a_2556d4dc",
      "revId": "8d94fc8385460d1f1074f9e5352b154c967b371c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
